   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Bright, clean, true-to-life: bright midtones (~181), clean whites (~250), slightly lifted blacks (~27), natural saturation (0.26), healthy warm-pink skin. Best for: All-round wedding coverage where colours must stay true (client-safe family portraits, decor shots, group photos, day rituals). Great default set for a full gallery.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
